<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-700 to-orange-500 min-h-screen">
<div class="space-y-8">
<h1 class="text-3xl font-mono underline">Deployment Options</h1>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-mono underline mt-4">These are some options for deploying your apps to the web.</h12
<ul class="space-y-8">
  <li>
     <%= link_to "Heroku", "https://www.heroku.com", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank %>
      <h2 class="text-xl">-Heroku is a platform as a service (PaaS) that enables developers to build, run, and operate applications entirely in the cloud.</h2>
  </li>
   <li>
     <%= link_to "Vercel", "https://www.vercel.com", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">-Your complete platform for the web. Vercel provides the developer tools and cloud infrastructure to build, scale, and secure a faster, more personalized web.</h2>
  </li>
  <li>
     <%= link_to "Netlify", "https://www.netlify.com", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">-Netlify is the essential platform for the delivery of exceptional and dynamic web experiences, without limitations.</h2>
  </li>
   <li>
     <%= link_to "Firebase", "https://firebase.google.com", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">-Discover Firebase, Google's mobile and web app development platform that helps developers build apps and games that users will love.</h2>
  </li>
   <li>
     <%= link_to "GitHub Pages", "https://pages.github.com", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank %>
     <h2 class="text-xl">-Build your own site from scratch or generate one for your project. You get one site per GitHub account and organization, and unlimited project sites.</h2>
  </li>
   <li>
     <%= link_to "Amazon Web Services", "https://www.khanacademy.org", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">-Khan Academy is a free, online educational resource for all ages that offers a variety of learning tools and resources.</h2>
  </li>
  <li>
     <%= link_to "DigitalOcean", "https://www.coursera.org", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">-Coursera is the global online learning platform that offers anyone, anywhere access to online courses and degrees from world-class universities and companies.</h2>
  </li>
  <li>
     <%= link_to "Railway", "https://www.stackoverflow.com", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">-Stack Overflow is the largest, most trusted online community for developers to learn, share​ ​their programming ​knowledge, and build their careers.</h2>
  </li>
   <li>
     <%= link_to "Surge", "https://www.codewars.com", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">-Codewars is an online platform for learning and practicing coding skills through a variety of programming challenges.</h2>
  </li>
   <li>
     <%= link_to "Render", "https://www.edx.org", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">-edX is the online learning platform from world-leading digital education company 2U, Inc. edX was founded by Harvard and MIT as an experiment to make the world’s best education available to everyone.</h2>
  </li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
